          "label": null,
          "visual_type": null,
          "elements": [],
          "connections": [],
          "rows": [],
          "caption": null,
          "alt_text": null
        },
        {
          "type": "example",
          "content": "If you misspell a URL and get a 404, the client request had a problem. If the website crashes because its database is down, it returns a 500 server error.",
